        },
        {
          "text": "I kom jo pa Kebron giketo Kacabia ki omegine ma gikwiri ma romo alip acel ki miya abiro me ne no tic ma i Icrael ma loka Jordan yo tuŋ potoceŋ, pi tic pa Rwot ducu ki pi tic pa kabaka bene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.30",
